[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14048.87, "timestamp": "03:54:08", "text": "该死。所以，要知道我们有10分钟的时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14051.03, "timestamp": "03:54:11", "text": "这东西有个窗户。不，我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14053.91, "timestamp": "03:54:13", "text": "以为它会永远持续下去。我来开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14063.03, "timestamp": "03:54:23", "text": "我们可以将其设置得更长时间，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14063.79, "timestamp": "03:54:23", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14070.63, "timestamp": "03:54:30", "text": "是啊，太好了。现在你需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14073.51, "timestamp": "03:54:33", "text": "吃吧？我们可以像这样总结一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14081.03, "timestamp": "03:54:41", "text": "今天学到的东西真有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14086.389, "timestamp": "03:54:46", "text": "关于飞机以及它真正好在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14088.309, "timestamp": "03:54:48", "text": "然后你就进入游戏了，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14090.87, "timestamp": "03:54:50", "text": "你也知道，这很有意义。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14093.59, "timestamp": "03:54:53", "text": "想要一架喷气式飞机，大约需要3天时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14096.309, "timestamp": "03:54:56", "text": "你把这一切都忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14099.51, "timestamp": "03:54:59", "text": "玩家的恶意怒火占据了上风，就是这样。"}]